-- v1430: Seed / sample data — Programme, Donors, Grants & Field Operations registers (v1429) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-11: sample data where it was missing, 10 records for each Programme, Donors, Grants & Field Operations register,
-- for SEED334-PRJ-08 (NGO / Development pack).
-- Fictional scenario for SEED334-PRJ-08: Riverside Aid International runs the Safe Water and Resilient Livelihoods
-- (SWRL) programme in Kenya, Uganda and Tanzania, April 2025 – March 2028, plus nine smaller programmes in
-- East Africa. Donors and partners are fictional. Dated around today (11 Nov 2026): year 2, mid-term review
-- planned for January 2027.
-- Records: overview 10, countries 10, communities 10, themes 10, milestones 10, donors 10, agreements 10, grants 10, offices 10, teams 10, activity_plans 10, missions 10.
-- Vendor-neutral (rule 26), person fields are plain text. display_id is left blank so Admin ID
-- Generation assigns it (rule 16.2). Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-c201- … c20c- (ranges checked free
-- before use). ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING, and nothing is inserted if the project is missing.
-- Calculated values are worked out with the same rules as the app. The final query counts the
-- records per register, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1429. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

